lets say I do:
a=seq(1, 9, by = 2)
This will give me:
[1] 1 3 5 7 9

If I do:
a=seq(1, 10, by = 2)
This will give me the same:
[1] 1 3 5 7 9

is there a way to force it to include the 10 (i.e. return [1] 1 3 5 7 9 10)
without adding it myself or doing any calculations?

